      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is an **excellently considered** licensing strategy. You've clearly studied how successful open standards navigate the complex tradeoffs between adoption, protection, and sustainability. Let me build on your analysis with some specific thoughts for LD-C's context."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Strategic Enhancements for LD-C**"
