      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Finance Patent Landscape**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Financial institutions patent everything. You need explicit protection:"
