    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In addition to the Apache 2.0 patent grant, contributors grant:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Financial Method Patent License**: A royalty-free license to any patents"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "covering financial methods, business processes, or trading strategies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "that would be infringed by implementing the LD-C specification."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Implementation Patent License**: A royalty-free license to any patents"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "covering data structures, algorithms, or system architectures necessarily"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "employed to create a compliant LD-C implementation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-107",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Defensive Termination**: If any entity brings patent litigation against"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-108",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "an LD-C implementer, all patent licenses from that entity to the LD-C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-109",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "project are automatically terminated."
