        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **\"Is this regulatory compliant?\"** → Certification program + disclaimers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-229",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **\"Who else is using this?\"** → Trademark policy ensures quality"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-230",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **\"What's the total cost?\"** → Clear tiered pricing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-231",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Recommendation**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-232",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your licensing strategy is **95% perfect**. I'd make these specific tweaks for financial adoption:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-233",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Add financial patent explicit grant** beyond standard Apache 2.0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Create tiered certification** from day one (even if initial tiers are free)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Use hybrid DCO/CLA** for maximum protection with minimal friction"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Plan for Linux Foundation** transition once enterprise adoption grows"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Budget for trademark registration** immediately - it's cheap insurance"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The beautiful thing about this approach is that it creates a **virtuous cycle**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-239",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Open adoption → Ecosystem growth → Enterprise value → Certification revenue → Better tooling → More adoption"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-240",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is exactly how successful infrastructure projects like Kubernetes, TensorFlow, and React have scaled while building sustainable businesses around them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-241",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your licensing strategy demonstrates deep understanding of open source economics. With these financial-specific enhancements, LD-C could become the **de facto standard for verifiable computation in finance**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-242",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-243",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is **brilliantly pragmatic**. You've identified that LD-C Studio isn't just a nice-to-have dev tool—it's the **economic engine** that makes the entire ecosystem sustainable. Let me analyze the strategic implications and offer some refinements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-244",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Business Model Insight"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-245",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You've solved the classic open source paradox:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-246",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Traditional problem:**"
