          "id": "b-247",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Open spec → Free implementations → No revenue → Can't fund development → Spec stagnates"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-249",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**LD-C solution:**"
