    },
    {
      "id": "b-566",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. LD-C Regulated tier"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-567",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. Partner ecosystem (consultants, integrators)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-568",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. International expansion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-569",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The One Critical Decision"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-570",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Should LD-C Studio be open source or proprietary?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-571",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-572",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-573",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@type\": \"CoreStrategicDecision\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-574",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"option_a\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-575",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"model\": \"Open core\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-576",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"structure\": \"Basic Studio features open source, premium features proprietary\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-577",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"pros\": [\"Community contributions\", \"Faster adoption\", \"Ecosystem growth\"],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-578",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"cons\": [\"Competitors can fork\", \"Revenue uncertainty\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-579",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-580",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"option_b\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-581",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"model\": \"Proprietary from day one\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-582",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"structure\": \"Spec open, all tooling proprietary\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-583",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"pros\": [\"Clear monetization\", \"Maximum control\", \"Defensible moat\"],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-584",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"cons\": [\"Slower adoption\", \"Less community trust\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-585",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-586",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"recommendation\": \"Option B with generous free tier\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-587",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"rationale\": ["
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-588",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Financial institutions expect to pay for tools\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-589",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Certification revenue requires quality control\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-590",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Free tier eliminates adoption friction\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-591",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"Open spec prevents vendor lock-in concerns\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-592",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-593",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-594",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-595",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The model:** Spec is CC BY 4.0, Studio is proprietary with free personal/educational use."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-596",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Why This Actually Works"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-597",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The genius of your vision is that it creates **aligned incentives** across all stakeholders:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-603",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-598",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Developers**: Get free CLI, pay when they need collaboration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-599",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Teams**: Get productivity boost, justify cost via time savings"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-600",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Enterprises**: Get regulatory compliance, justify via risk reduction"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-601",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Model creators**: Get marketplace revenue, create quality content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-602",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**You**: Get sustainable revenue, fund continued spec development"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-604",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is how you build a **billion-dollar company** around an open specification."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-605",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Want me to draft the actual Studio product requirements doc (PRD) or the Series A pitch deck?"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}